                                "text": "Trading in their battered RV and Louisiana swamplands for a sumptuous pink mansionette with swimming pool, the Malloys pull off their ruse with skill and also childish naïveté."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "106522ba-7a35-44f9-9fd3-b931622afc51",
                                "sense_id": "55fe7e98-40bc-392b-8150-95854eb26be5",
                                "text": "The swampland is an extensive pegasse swamp, which is rich in organic matter and intensely acidic."
